==Battleground==
*3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns.
**5 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Bearkini]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Dashing Face]] spawns.
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns.

